{"1568600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "ASSAULT SECTOR", "steam_appid": 1568600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/b5ed7813c836e0b6f4c2c74ae79e5e7f.avif?t=1772198724\" width=1170 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are on a mission to solve one of the biggest issues in Multiplayer FPS - <strong>camping!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to ASSAULT SECTOR, an old-school inspired PvP Arena Shooter with a revolutionary twist: <strong>PULSE.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/a8a889359c53df07fa762ae7d488822f.poster.avif?t=1772198724\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/a8a889359c53df07fa762ae7d488822f.webm?t=1772198724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/a8a889359c53df07fa762ae7d488822f.mp4?t=1772198724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/a04ee895da14fe6f3e60d8e561188a51.avif?t=1772198724\" width=1170 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ASSAULT SECTOR, every player spawns with PULSE, which recharges through teamwork and combat. Camping is a thing of the past. Focus on hunting your enemies, strategizing with your team, and dominating the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/cb69112cbc71174f58ea9910e53376a7.poster.avif?t=1772198724\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/cb69112cbc71174f58ea9910e53376a7.webm?t=1772198724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/cb69112cbc71174f58ea9910e53376a7.mp4?t=1772198724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/cd2f0c13c369fcb66490adccec61c922.avif?t=1772198724\" width=1170 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip a versatile arsenal of gears, including <strong>ammo boxes</strong>, <strong>medkits</strong>, <strong>shields</strong>, <strong>transportation grenades</strong>, and <strong>tactical devices</strong>. Each item is designed to enhance combat, reveal enemies, and provide strategic advantages on the arena.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/e88cdacfa3fcbe79af73e412e6eb0f7c.poster.avif?t=1772198724\" width=1170 height=424 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/e88cdacfa3fcbe79af73e412e6eb0f7c.webm?t=1772198724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/e88cdacfa3fcbe79af73e412e6eb0f7c.mp4?t=1772198724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/508984873b142618c7bcf4c5a94a8b86.avif?t=1772198724\" width=1170 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons are crucial in ASSAULT SECTOR, and we've ensured they feel silky smooth. Choose from <strong>Assault Rifles</strong>, <strong>SMGs</strong>, <strong>Sniper Rifles</strong>, <strong>DMRs</strong>, <strong>LMGs</strong>, <strong>Shotguns</strong>, and more. Customize your arsenal with a range of skins and attachments to match your unique playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/93d9d0add083b4aa8e3c191296ce2396.poster.avif?t=1772198724\" width=1170 height=848 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/93d9d0add083b4aa8e3c191296ce2396.webm?t=1772198724\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/93d9d0add083b4aa8e3c191296ce2396.mp4?t=1772198724\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/89a829b2314731d538ca3856ab93bf6f.avif?t=1772198724\" width=1170 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In ASSAULT SECTOR, you can choose from five distinct classes:  <strong>INFANTRY</strong> | <strong>CLONE</strong> | <strong>CYBER</strong> |  <strong>DARK-OPS</strong> | <strong>RECON</strong><br>Each class offers specific perks, gadgets, and unique abilities. Whether you prefer aggressive, stealth, defensive, or ranged gameplay, we have you covered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/da205fd40c9c98fec96533b25aae3c08.avif?t=1772198724\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras_big/da205fd40c9c98fec96533b25aae3c08.avif?t=1772198724 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/fb82bcd17dc4a816ba7c2fc67a75b260.avif?t=1772198724\" width=1170 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience intense action with four distinct game modes, each offering unique challenges and strategic gameplay. Whether outmaneuvering opponents or engaging in all-out combat, every mode delivers a fresh experience for different playstyles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/79ba65615ffa171acc51f2130d7ff6ef.avif?t=1772198724\" width=1440 height=524 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1568600/extras/5bb0c8326a1d24c45c369f79bd567cda.avif?t=1772198724\" width=1170 height=98 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ASSAULT SECTOR will evolve over time. While it may not be a feature-complete, AAA game at launch, we're committed to continuous improvement. Game development is a challenging and labor-intensive process, and we invite you to join us on this journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Please <strong>join our <u>Discord</u></strong> or <strong>follow us on <u>X (Twitter)</u></strong> to share your feedback. If you like what you see, <u><strong>Wishlist</strong></u><strong> us on Steam</strong> to support our ongoing i